WEBVTT

00:23:59.788 --> 00:24:03.246
And what I thought I'd do with that
is become a great American writer.

00:24:04.329 --> 00:24:08.038
That's what I thought I'd do
with that I was absolutely

00:24:09.038 --> 00:24:15.621
relentlessly, ruthlessly committed to
following through and being, you know,

00:24:15.746 --> 00:24:19.704
just really, really, you know, holding
hard onto that thread.

00:24:19.704 --> 00:24:23.704
That was my writing and doing it
and doing it and doing it until

00:24:24.204 --> 00:24:31.913
I succeeded. And you know, it's funny,
as I say, these words, you know,